SUMMARY:Supreme Court: The petition of two transparency activists on Delhi'
 s revision\, W.P.(C) No. 1188 of 2026
DESCRIPTION:The petition of two transparency activists on Delhi's revision\
 , W.P.(C) No. 1188 of 2026. On 19 November the Court asked the Election Co
 mmission to give the number of enumeration forms filled and of Form 6\, Fo
 rm 7 and Form 8 applications made. It said it would then take stock and co
 nsider whether to extend the deadline for electors left off the draft roll
 . Court: Supreme Court. Source: Hindustan Times\, https://www.hindustantim
 es.com/cities/delhi-news/sc-seeks-delhi-sir-progress-data-to-decide-on-dea
 dline-extension-101795112193973.html More: https://offtheroll.in/india/dis
 putes/#d-court-89
